Welcome to the Houston Texans App, your official digital guide to make your mobile device your 24/7 connection to your favorite team in H-Town!
With this new update, enjoy the following additions:

- Full mobile ticketing experience with personalized navigation;
- Houston Texans Arcade experience with chances to win signed merch, prices from Texans partners and more;
- Customized App Icons;
- Ticketmaster updates with exclusive opportunities and content through logging on;
- In-stadium opportunities to elevate the gameday experience with the ability to order and pay for merch and concessions!
